[anicel 0004] embedder: doors to let a lost OpenGL context go and stand again

Board a-real-gpu-reset-went-unheard-on-the-main-pc, step two.

- FlutterEngineNotifyGLContextLost: on the raster thread the surface lets
  go (no thread reacts, nothing is made current, the context is cleared)
  and the texture registry forgets its images; the platform view is
  destroyed; on the IO thread the resource context is released. After it
  returns the engine calls no OpenGL callback and has no context current.
- FlutterEngineNotifyGLContextRestored: on the raster thread the surface
  makes the new context current and tells Impeller it was replaced
  (0003); the platform view is created again and a frame is drawn.
- A thread of the Impeller GL surface reacts only where its context was
  made current: upstream let it react before it heard whether it could be.

